{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S01和尤其S05的感受词偏密，S05只有18秒，未分时出现的感受内容容易来不及扫；这方面Y更利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮短语建立了清楚的阅读入口，观众即使边听边扫，也比较容易抓住每段叙事的核心转折；分时出现的感受又能跟音乐进程对应，不必一次消化全部信息。尤其在音乐细节、身体感受、光影和情绪变化上，X比Y具体得多，感受不是简单贴几个情绪标签，而是能让人感到变化怎样发生。两版的心理因果和故事主线其实都比较完整，X的主要问题是个别短时段的感受层过密，细腻有余而留给观众消化的时间不足。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "866b31a2-d7b5-44ca-984c-7432c612614c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T043204740752Z", "elapsed_seconds": 122.079, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:34:06.828406+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "80ae6837f6d4b64940a6d857b45f9a90d1017226050bb2ac79abe144816caaaa", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt